    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd8d MULTIPLAYER UPDATE IS NOW LIVE! \ud83e\udd8d</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Showdown: Gorilla vs 100 - Now with Online Multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Showdown: Gorilla vs 100</strong> has just received a large update- <strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong> is now available!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae What's New?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER MODE - Alpha!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or join rooms with players from around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for up to 20 players per room - <i>planning on increasing the amount if needed</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player becomes the mighty Gorilla while everyone else must work together to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless host migration and stable networking powered by Photon Fusion</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/extras/7e235c1f3b282db74fe66433cb5b5ae6.avif?t=1753923225\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot has changed \u2014 here\u2019s what\u2019s coming in the next update!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fresh and exciting experience with all-new content and features dropping at release:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>New Upgrade Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power up in new ways and customize your playstyle even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Wave Modifiers</strong> \u2013 Randomly selected challenges added to specific waves keep every run unpredictable and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Wave Tasks</strong> \u2013 Complete mini-objectives mid-run to earn bonus currency and experience to boost your character even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Time-Trial Waves</strong> \u2013 Finish waves quickly and rack up even bigger rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>New Map</strong> \u2013 Dive into a brand-new environment featuring water hazards and improved visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>New Block Ability</strong> \u2013 Defend yourself and outlast your enemies with the all-new blocking mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Updated Animations</strong> \u2013 Smoother, sharper, and more expressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and <strong>much more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t wait for you all to jump in and experience the chaos! \ud83d\udca5</p></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dookie added plus much more!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/extras/b1944b3191140638804a4ac9a831a6d9.avif?t=1753923225\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think it was a much needed addition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo dev here trying my best to finish this game while trying to balance work and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a lot of great updates to my game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience progression system</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience pickup orbs</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item unlock system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemy type (thrower)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated enemy types</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks now stomp and cause ground eruption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomber explosions</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI sound and animations tweaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings added</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoping to release in the upcoming few weeks. Hope everyone enjoys and <strong>if this interests you,</strong> <strong>Wishlist is available.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the gorilla.<br>They are the 100 men.<br>Only one side walks away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Showdown: Gorilla vs. 100</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top <i>roguelike/roguelite</i> brawler where you take on wave after wave of determined (but mostly doomed) human opponents. With physics-driven ragdoll mayhem, every punch, throw, and slam is uniquely hilarious and brutally satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Why fight 100 men?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the internet won't stop arguing about it.<br>Because science won't answer the question.<br>Because you're a gorilla\u2014and gorillas don't need a reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 men. No mercy.</strong> Face a growing variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal ragdoll physics.</strong> Every hit is a spectacle thanks to dynamic animations and weighty combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike progression.</strong> Every run is different\u2014unlock gorilla upgrades, new abilities, and arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill meets silliness.</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master, and always hilarious to watch.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the gorilla.<br>They are the 100 men.<br>Only one side walks away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Showdown: Gorilla vs. 100</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top <i>roguelike/roguelite</i> brawler where you take on wave after wave of determined (but mostly doomed) human opponents. With physics-driven ragdoll mayhem, every punch, throw, and slam is uniquely hilarious and brutally satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Why fight 100 men?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the internet won't stop arguing about it.<br>Because science won't answer the question.<br>Because you're a gorilla\u2014and gorillas don't need a reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 men. No mercy.</strong> Face a growing variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal ragdoll physics.</strong> Every hit is a spectacle thanks to dynamic animations and weighty combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike progression.</strong> Every run is different\u2014unlock gorilla upgrades, new abilities, and arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill meets silliness.</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master, and always hilarious to watch.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A physics-based roguelike brawler where you play as a gorilla smashing your way through 100 men. Punch, throw, and ragdoll your enemies in chaotic, ever-changing game. Easy to pick up, wild to watch, and built to settle the internet\u2019s dumbest debate.",
